## Pipeline

Epic-scoped drafts: **`TEST-PREP:`** + Epic key → [`.cursor/pipelines/test-prep.md`](../.cursor/pipelines/test-prep.md) → `epics/<KEY>/<KEY>-tests.json` + `-tests.md`. Schema template: [`epics/templates/tests-ref.json`](../epics/templates/tests-ref.json). Full **draft** text for each bundle is produced in a **separate subprocess** (one bundle per run); see playbook phases **8a** / **8b**.
